title: "Qiushi Engine: Large-Scale Autonomous Discovery of Kissing Number Constructions"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Oxelra-AI/Qiushi-Engine-Kissing-Number-Research"
abstract: "Qiushi Engine's autonomous mathematical research develops new kissing-number constructions through connections between coding theory, lattice geometry and combinatorics. The collection includes bilingual research reports, mathematical arguments, exact construction data and reproducible verification programs."
